# CODEOWNERS — review routing. Place this file at .github/CODEOWNERS in each repo.
# Self-own the file (last matching pattern wins) so ownership changes require owner review.

# Default owner for everything in the repo:
* @Thriwe-2-0/<team>                      # ⚠ replace <team> with the real GitHub team slug

# Protect the ownership file itself:
/.github/CODEOWNERS @Thriwe-2-0/<team>    # ⚠

# Example path-based routing (uncomment + adjust):
# /helm/      @Thriwe-2-0/<team>
# /stacks/    @Thriwe-2-0/<infra-team>
# *.tf        @Thriwe-2-0/<infra-team>
